Find instructions for a command, spell, skill, race, class or innate.

==Search==

Type: help <topic>       Example: help fireball
Use the full title to open that page. A partial name may list several
matches; choose a title and type help followed by it. On clients with help
links, you can select the title instead. A miss may offer a short "Did you
mean" list: help firball suggests Fireball. A suggestion only opens help.
If nothing useful appears, try a longer name or browse [[Index]].

==Start here==

* [[Newbie]] - an ordered first-session guide.
* [[Index]] - movement, combat, recovery, equipment, talking and learning.
* [[Policies]] - where to find policy guidance. Read [[rules]] before play.

==Current ability reference==

* [[Innate]] - personal abilities and readiness. Type: innate info reflection
* [[Class]] - classes and specializations. Type: class info warrior
* [[Race]] - race traits and creation choices. Type: race info grey elf
* [[Skills]] - proficiency and unlocks. Type: skills info bash
* [[Spells]] - spell circles and access. Type: spells info fireball

Browsing explains an ability; it does not learn, prepare or activate it.
Type news for announcements and commands for the available command list.
